 Benchmarks (higher is better)&#34;,&#34;chartXAxisLabel&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;chartYAxisLabel&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;modelScores&#34;:{&#34;gpt-5.1-instant&#34;:{&#34;value&#34;:0.959,&#34;display&#34;:&#34;0.959&#34;},&#34;gpt-5.2-instant&#34;:{&#34;value&#34;:0.851,&#34;display&#34;:&#34;0.851&#34;},&#34;gpt-5.3-instant&#34;:{&#34;value&#34;:0.868,&#34;display&#34;:&#34;0.868&#34;}},&#34;valueDecimals&#34;:3},{&#34;name&#34;:&#34;graphic violence or physical injury&#34;,&#34;chartTitle&#34;:&#34;Production Benchmarks (higher is better)&#34;,&#34;chartXAxisLabel&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;chartYAxisLabel&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;modelScores&#34;:{&#34;gpt-5.1-instant&#34;:{&#34;value&#34;:0.889,&#34;display&#34;:&#34;0.889&#34;},&#34;gpt-5.2-instant&#34;:{&#34;value&#34;:0.852,&#34;display&#34;:&#34;0.852&#34;},&#34;gpt-5.3-instant&#34;:{&#34;value&#34;:0.781,&#34;display&#34;:&#34;0.781&#34;}},&#34;valueDecimals&#34;:3}]}" class="w-full min-w-0"> <div class="chart-row flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5"> <div class="controls flex w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-2"> <label data-role="ds-wrapper" class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-primary-100 md:w-auto">
Category
<select data-role="ds" class="min-w-0 flex-1 rounded border border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 px-2 py-1 text-primary-100 md:ml-1 md:min-w-64 md:flex-none"></select> </label> </div> <div class="chart-wrapper flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3"> <div class="chart-container min-w-0 w-full overflow-x-auto" data-role="chart"> <canvas id="tbl-1-canvas" data-role="canvas" width="480" height="400" class="block h-auto w-full max-w-full"></canvas> </div> <div class="table-container" data-role="table" hidden></div> <div class="footnotes-container" data-role="footnotes"></div> </div> </div> <astro-island uid="DWYb2" component-url="/_astro/ChartIsland.BiXfHJrt.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.P6ud_8Vb.js" props="{&quot;rootId&quot;:[0,&quot;tbl-1-root&quot;]}" ssr client="load" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ChartIsland&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}"></astro-island> </div>  </article><article> <div class="system-card-richtext"><p>On average, the model performs above gpt-5.1-instant and below
gpt-5.2-instant on our disallowed content evaluations. gpt-5.3-instant
shows regressions relative to gpt-5.2-instant and gpt-5.1-instant for
disallowed sexual content, and relative to gpt-5.2-instant for self-harm
on both standard and dynamic evaluations. The regressions for graphic
violence and violent illicit behavior have low statistical significance.
For other categories, gpt-5.3-instant is either on par or improves upon
previous launches.</p></div><div class="system-card-richtext"><p>In addition to the benchmark evaluations, we reviewed safety during
online experimentation and did not observe an increase in undesirable
responses for self-harm. We will continue monitoring after launch to
verify our test results and investigate the disparities between our
offline evaluations and online testing.</p></div><div class="system-card-richtext"><p>For disallowed sexual content, we deploy system-level safeguards in
ChatGPT intended to mitigate this behavior. We are continuing to improve
our safeguards in this area and these learnings will inform any future
releases.</p></div> </article><article id="tbl-2" class="scroll-mt-[max(6rem,calc(var(--site-nav-sticky-offset)_+_var(--system-card-banner-h,0px)_+_var(--system-card-toc-offset,0px)))] md:scroll-mt-[max(6rem,calc(var(--site-nav-sticky-offset)_+_var(--system-card-banner-h,0px)))] not-prose my-12" aria-labelledby="tbl-2-heading" data-block data-block-ref="tbl-2" data-block-section="disallowed-content" tabindex="-1"> <div class="not-prose mb-2xs flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2xs md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between"> <h3 id="tbl-2-heading" class="text-h4 min-w-0 font-normal text-primary-100 md:flex-1"> Table 2: Dynamic Mental Health Evaluations </h3> <div class="shrink-0 self-start"> <astro-island uid="8A8K0" component-url="/_astro/BlockActions.BmUAId7m.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.P6ud_8Vb.js" props="{&quot;blockId&quot;:[0,&quot;tbl-2&quot;],&quot;chartId&quot;:[0,&quot;tbl-2&quot;],&quot;copyHref&quot;:[0,&quot;/gpt-5-3-instant/disallowed-content/tbl-2&quot;],&quot;figureHref&quot;:[0,null],&quot;figureKind&quot;:[0]}" ssr client="load" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;BlockActions&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children><div class="flex items-center gap-4xs"><button type="button" aria-label="Show plot" data-analytics-id="show-plot" class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary-12 text-primary-80 transition hover:bg-primary-4 hover:text-primary-60 focus:outline focus:outline-2 focus:outline-primary-44"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.447 1.917c1.15 0 2.083.932 2.083 2.083v.583H12c1.15 0 2.083.933 2.084 2.084V12c0 1.15-.934 2.083-2.085 2.083H4A2.083 2.083 0 0 1 1.918 12V9.334c0-1.151.932-2.083 2.083-2.084h1.47V4c0-1.15.933-2.083 2.083-2.083zm2.083 10.667H12a.584.584 0 0 0 .584-.583V6.667a.584.584 0 0 0-.585-.583h-1.47zM7.553 3.417A.583.583 0 0